From: xboxnative contributors
Subject: [PATCH] d3dcompiler_47: link bundled vkd3d statically
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

Wine's d3dcompiler_47 imports its seven vkd3d_shader_* symbols through
wined3d.dll, which drags in opengl32/user32/gdi32/advapi32 — far more host
surface than a shader compiler needs. Link Wine's bundled static libvkd3d.a
into the DLL instead (dxguid supplies the IID_ID3D12* constants libvkd3d.a
references; --allow-multiple-definition resolves the GUID constants it shares
with reflection.o's initguid definitions — identical read-only constants, no
behavior change). The donor then imports only kernel32/ntdll/ucrtbase.

--- a/dlls/d3dcompiler_47/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/d3dcompiler_47/Makefile.in
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
 MODULE    = d3dcompiler_47.dll
 IMPORTLIB = d3dcompiler
-IMPORTS   = wined3d
+IMPORTS   = vkd3d dxguid
 EXTRADEFS = -DD3D_COMPILER_VERSION=47
 PARENTSRC = ../d3dcompiler_43
 EXTRAINCL = $(VKD3D_PE_CFLAGS)

-EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--prefer-native
+EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--prefer-native -Wl,--allow-multiple-definition

 SOURCES = \
